    "reason": "[ev-7424e74176c0] says support for L7 protocol visibility using the Pod annotation `policy.cilium.io/proxy-visibility` \"has been removed\" in 1.17. Pods that still carry the annotation therefore lose the L7 visibility it used to turn on: the configured value is no longer honoured. That is setting-ignored (mandatory work), not a deprecation that still works. Medium severity is reasonable because the loss is visibility, not connectivity.",
